; XAU300_ORB_CappedRecovery_Research preset R3_marti1p5_base3: recovery ON, base 3%, x1.5 per level (3% / 4.5% / 6.75%)
; RESEARCH ONLY - HIGH RISK - NOT A LIVE RECOMMENDATION. Pre-registered 2026-11-08 before any MT5 run (4 presets max).
; Identical across R0-R3 except InpRiskPercent / InpRecoveryOn / InpRecoveryMultiplier.
; Common: DD stop 30% (buffer below the user's 35% backtest limit), daily hard stop 3%, spread gate 0 (real spread paid),
;         max level 2 (levels 0,1,2), risk cap 8%, max lot 0.10, never forced to the minimum lot.
; Effective risk above 3% means a losing trade is normally closed by the daily stop before its full SL.
; DD stop is a trigger, not a guarantee: gaps/slippage can exceed it. Nothing here guarantees DD <= 35%.
